OL,3,GNEWSA'Our estate has a community which
OL,4,Agets forgotten'
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people living in a neighbourhood
OL,7,Fwhere violence broke out on Bonfire
OL,8,FNight say it is too often defined by
OL,9,Fdisorder, while positive work goes
OL,10,Funnoticed.
OL,12,FThe Meadow Well estate in North
OL,13,FTyneside was in the headlines last week
OL,14,Fwhen fireworks and bricks were launched
OL,15,Fat emergency services.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
