OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Our estate has a community which
OL,4,Agets forgotten'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Phoenix Detached Youth Project is
OL,7,Fdesigned to give teenagers and young
OL,8,Fadults living there opportunities to
OL,9,Fimprove their neighbourhood, and
OL,10,Fattendees said positive things
OL,11,Fhappening there rarely attracted the
OL,12,Fsame attention as the crime.
OL,14,FChief executive and youth worker Luke
OL,15,FJohnston said: "People are quick to
OL,16,Fjump on the negative, but it's a battle
OL,17,Fto get people to come and see the
OL,18,Fpositive."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
